(3, 4, 6, 'Kian Bluechester', 28, 'grizzled war veteran of the intial war in the human dimension', 'Laborer', 1, 166, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 25, 100, 70, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-03-23 19:20:46', NULL, NULL, '2026-03-18 21:50:50', '2026-07-31 23:37:32'),
(4, 5, 1, 'Fox Redsman', 19, 'A devoted Red that cares deeply for the Empire. Believes in the red army, having joined at enlistment age.', 'Laborer', 20, 32315, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 11, 88, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 1, 1, '2026-08-07 01:46:33', '2026-08-04 20:25:00', NULL, '2026-07-04 18:01:21', '2026-08-07 01:46:33'),
(5, 8, 1, 'Drew', 45, 'upstart general hoping to bring the red empire to globe supremacy.', 'Begger', 4, 665, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 346, 100, 85, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-07 21:16:40', '2026-08-05 02:51:58', NULL, '2026-07-25 15:50:07', '2026-08-07 21:16:40'),
(6, 10, 1, 'Bigbill296', 24, 'A soldier of the red army who is very loyal to the principles of the Red Empire', 'Begger', 3, 77, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 46, 100, 25, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-06 13:03:53', '2026-08-04 19:17:35', NULL, '2026-07-27 04:58:06', '2026-08-06 13:03:53'),
(7, 6, 5, 'Dino H. Wolfblood', 22, 'fell in love with the Idea of exploring a brave new world and signed up for the colonial corps. being the 3rd son of a 4th generation farmer meant he was free to pursue his ambitions as he wished', 'Laborer', 20, 35912, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 21, 1103, 100, 100, 0, 'civilian', 1, 0, '2026-08-08 00:16:09', '2026-08-04 20:07:41', NULL, '2026-07-31 23:27:59', '2026-08-08 00:17:11'),
(8, 11, 6, 'Luke Helios', 16, 'The boy king.', 'Laborer', 20, 6360, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 323, 100, 80, 0, 'military', 1, 1, '2026-08-08 04:36:23', '2026-08-04 14:01:11', NULL, '2026-07-31 23:37:07', '2026-08-08 04:36:23'),
(9, 14, 3, 'Lord Regent Malcor', 34, 'Overseer of the whole Tan empire, leader and genreal willing to do what I can to restore our old lands.', 'Laborer', 16, 3241, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 94, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 13:21:10', '2026-08-08 03:03:07', NULL, '2026-08-01 00:47:43', '2026-08-08 13:21:10'),
(10, 17, 6, 'Henry Calix', 26, 'Staunch supporter of Blutannia.\r\nSkin: Blue\r\nEyes: Blue\r\nFavorite color: Blue', 'Begger', 20, 21536, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 15, 85, 100, 40, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 15:21:34', '2026-08-04 02:45:09', NULL, '2026-08-01 02:08:15', '2026-08-08 15:21:34'),
(11, 12, 4, 'Malaki', 30, 'Malaki born in Tan Aviv. His hobbies are doing historian work, and archaeological work. Married to black barbie doll name Hannah. \r\n\r\nWhen the Reds invaded he joined the rebels and help form Tan Aviv Liberation Force and created the Home Guard unit for the Tan Aviv Liberation Force.', 'Begger', 20, 34279, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 16, 425, 100, 100, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-08 15:50:56', '2026-08-05 16:00:50', NULL, '2026-08-01 06:03:41', '2026-08-08 15:50:59'),
(12, 13, 2, 'Glazten Nugget', 52, 'Longtime servant of the Kingdom of Greenland, Nugget started out in the lower ranks of the military stations in Valleyput. From there, throughout the war a mix of intelligence and wartime promotions got him to the rank of Brigadier General. Of course, in his off time he managed to begin growing a news business in the human dimension, constructing himself an office tower out of a wooden crate.', 'Begger', 20, 9516, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 8, 139, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-06 13:15:43', '2026-08-04 04:36:36', NULL, '2026-08-01 13:24:50', '2026-08-06 13:15:43'),
(13, 21, 2, 'James Brown', 20, 'a civlian who had worked in consutrction beofre the war kicked off', 'Begger', 1, 3, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 100, 85, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-01 13:46:39', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 13:45:25', '2026-08-01 13:47:04'),
(14, 22, 2, 'Velikan', 24, 'Velikan grew up in a small town with his parents and younger sister. They weren\'t rich, but they were happy. Everything changed when a bombing destroyed his hometown, killing his entire family while he survived by chance.\r\n\r\nThe loss filled him with grief, guilt, and anger. Wanting to make sure no one else suffered the way he did—and to one day face those responsible—he enlisted in the military. Through relentless training, he became a disciplined and determined soldier, carrying the memory of his family with him on every mission.', 'Begger', 1, 140, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 20, 100, 40, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-01 13:53:35', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-01 13:46:21', '2026-08-01 13:53:35'),
(15, 7, 2, 'John \"CJ\" GreenWolf', 80, 'Cj was a lieutenant during green operations in Viettan in efforts to help them repel the red invaders gurung the gbt alliance. Due to his efforts and the survivors of a failed airborne mission elements of dog company and the company that managed to make it home to Greenland were reformed into the 101st green dragons as CJ was promoted from captain to major.\r\n\r\nAfter several months of work under the direct command of lieutenant colonel Lupo, Major CJ was then promoted to the rank of lieutenant colonel as lupo had taken early retirement.\r\n\r\nAfter the reds were pushed out of viettan CJ later recieved a promotion ro colonel and later general.\r\n\r\nMany years later CJ was elected prime minister and led greenland through an invasion that later came known as operation false throne, he served Queen Ivy and ensured the defence of the great Green nation held no matter what.\r\n\r\nAfter the tans, blues and greys were repelled amd false throne had failed he later bought a house for his wife and 3 kids in the human dimension and later too his wifes name which was GreenWolf.\r\n\r\nAfter returning from the human dimensionfrom his leave CJ participated in the formation of the UCP amd helped plastica defeat amd repel obsidian and purl.\r\n\r\nDue to CJs record the royal family and the rest of high command sealed most of his records to help ensure they couldn\'t be used against the green nation.\r\n\r\nCJs full name after changing his name now is now John \"CJ\" GreenWolf.', 'Begger', 20, 24308, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 13, 282, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-08 15:06:27', '2026-08-04 19:58:00', NULL, '2026-08-01 15:36:05', '2026-08-08 15:06:27'),
(16, 23, 2, 'LTG ZMAN', 33, 'Zman began his service as a Sergeant when the first war in the Human dimension began. He was soon recruited into the Greenland Special Forces known as the Green Berets. He then became a First Sergeant of the 101st Airborne Rangers Green Star Company, and then its Commander and Captain. His service in both Great Plastic wars in the Human dimension, and Plastica he earned the rank of Major. Major Zman then created the Greenland Special Operations Forces (GSOF). Zmans skills pushed him to become part of the most elite unit known as Delta Force or (SABRE) team. Overtime Zman would earn Lieutenant Colonel and then Colonel. His long service between both the Human dimension and Plastica, and skills on the battlefield have earned him the rank of Lieutenant General and Deputy Chief of Greenlands Armed Forces.', 'Begger', 20, 32784, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 14, 57, 100, 60, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-08 06:11:07', '2026-08-04 07:28:32', NULL, '2026-08-01 16:05:37', '2026-08-08 06:11:07'),
(17, 24, 5, 'Purturabo', 23, 'Fresh Bachelor from the city whos parents were teachers and military leaders making sure he had access to good education and martial discipline. His wish to see his nation prosper is strong!', 'Begger', 3, 3645, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 182, 100, 55, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-05 04:26:03', '2026-08-02 04:03:31', NULL, '2026-08-02 00:20:14', '2026-08-05 04:26:03'),
(18, 16, 5, 'Levi Jacob Taube', 21, 'A young gray man who join the military to defend the fatherland against evil blues and in name of kaiser', 'Begger', 4, 20825, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 7, 50, 100, 70, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-06 21:13:48', '2026-08-04 02:46:33', NULL, '2026-08-02 08:04:57', '2026-08-06 21:13:48'),
(19, 26, 5, 'paul von mahnstein', 22, 'a knowledge fillied and intelligent man looks to make Graul great again and restore its borders', 'Begger', 3, 3766, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 135, 100, 0, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-02 20:01:12', '2026-08-02 15:21:15', NULL, '2026-08-02 14:31:42', '2026-08-04 20:02:28'),
(20, 27, 8, 'Mojo Da Smuggler', 20, 'Mojo da Smuggler is a 20-year-old runner, trader, and covert courier who has earned a reputation for slipping through blockades that most captains wouldn\'t dare approach. Raised among the crowded docks of Purl, Mojo learned early that survival depended on quick thinking, faster feet, and knowing who to trust. By his teenage years, he was already transporting contraband between isolated settlements, building a network of contacts that stretched across the fractured nation.\r\n\r\nWhen civil war erupted between the New Purleanse Republic and Obsidian Purl, Mojo chose to support the New Purleanse Republic. While many smugglers stayed neutral to profit from both sides, Mojo believed the Republic\'s reformist ideals offered hope for a fairer future. He now uses his skills to deliver medicine, food, intelligence, and supplies through dangerous territory, helping Republic soldiers and civilians evade Obsidian Purl patrols.\r\n\r\nMojo isn\'t a frontline soldier. Instead, he wages war through stealth, deception, and speed. His favorite tactics include disguising shipments as ordinary merchant cargo, using forgotten waterways, and bribing corrupt checkpoint guards when necessary. His resourcefulness has made him one of the Republic\'s most valuable unofficial operatives.\r\n\r\nDespite his confidence and sarcastic sense of humor, Mojo carries the weight of the war heavily. Friends and family have been caught on both sides of the conflict, forcing him to make impossible decisions about loyalty and survival. He refuses to become cruel, believing that the Republic should win without losing the values it claims to fight for.\r\n\r\nKnown for his patched long coat, weathered satchel, and ever-present grin, Mojo has become something of a folk hero among Republic supporters. To Obsidian Purl, however, he is a wanted smuggler responsible for countless successful supply runs and intelligence leaks. A growing bounty on his head increases. He believes every successful run will lead to a better Purl.', 'Begger', 13, 1073, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 2, 50, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-03 02:48:54', '2026-08-08 01:36:38', NULL, '2026-08-02 14:42:04', '2026-08-08 01:36:38'),
(21, 20, 2, 'Jonathan Anderson', 23, 'Jonathan Anderson was born to newlywed parents, the first of seven children. His father, a Commander in the Green Navy, narrowly avoided an untimely demise when the fleet was attacked in Plastic Pearl Harbor. \r\nHis best friend in his childhood was another navy brat named Ethan Virid. A year after Ethan’s family was moved to Greenington, that city was wiped out by the nuclear attack, and Ethan and his whole family were killed. Ethan’s death hit Jonathan hard, and he became his friends’ and family’s avenger. If you messed with one of his brothers, he cleaned your clock, and if you messed with one of his sisters, you better leave town. \r\nJonathan did not follow his father’s footsteps into the navy; he never liked the sea, and the long voyages would make it hard for Jonathan to keep an eye watching over his family. Instead, he went to school, hoping to get work as a technician at the naval yards.\r\nJonathan’s next younger brother, Rosser, joined the Mighty Green Army immediately after graduation, while Jonathan was finishing his studies. Sadly, 2LT Rosser Anderson was killed in action at Tangier Pass during Operation Breakthrough. Immediately upon hearing of his brother’s death, Jonathan found an Army recruiting station and enlisted, distinguished himself in basic training, and went off to officers’ school. He needed vengeance upon the enemies of Greenland, but he has a particular dislike of Reds.\r\nAn aggressive but intelligent officer, Captain Jonathan Anderson is extremely loyal to his friends and his men. He believes in attacking whenever possible, with superior firepower. He prefers to lead from the front, though Captains don’t typically have that responsibility. He is tough on his subordinates, but will go to great lengths for their wellbeing when he sees their need. Most importantly, he is firmly dedicated to serving Greenland and her people.', 'Begger', 20, 2699, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 10, 260, 100, 40, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-08 15:16:36', '2026-08-04 17:52:39', NULL, '2026-08-02 15:27:27', '2026-08-08 15:16:36'),
(22, 28, 6, 'Mark Bluvival', 53, 'A veteran of several wars, Mark Bluvival was a Captain in the Blutannian military, surviving Cardboard City and rising to the rank of Major in command of the 713th Armored Regiment, Rhino Company before retiring to civilian life. Currently Mark has become an advisor to the new government but refuses to take combat action.', 'Begger', 3, 438, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 65, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-03 02:00:55', '2026-08-03 01:23:59', NULL, '2026-08-02 16:10:31', '2026-08-03 22:44:52'),
(23, 29, 8, 'Sir Jacob', 35, 'Sir Jacob of the Purlanese Imperial Army', 'Begger', 4, 38952, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 11, 125, 100, 70, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-07 02:35:43', '2026-08-03 22:28:37', NULL, '2026-08-02 17:54:53', '2026-08-07 02:35:43'),
(24, 30, 8, 'Amethyst', 16, 'I like the mines in purl hands,\r\nI like the mines when it is free,\r\nI like the mines in purl hands,\r\nI love the mines, I love the mines.', 'Begger', 1, 527, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1, 40, 100, 0, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-02 22:50:23', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-02 18:02:41', '2026-08-02 22:50:23'),
(25, 31, 6, 'Cassian \"Iron Wolf\" Ashford', 23, 'Personal Motto\r\n\"Victory belongs to the prepared.\"\r\n\r\nCassian grew up in the prestigious Harbor District of Kingsport, Blutannia\'s great naval capital.\r\nThe streets were filled with admirals, politicians, merchants and wealthy shipping families.\r\n\r\nInstead of toy soldiers...\r\n\r\nHe spent hours studying naval maps, military campaigns and kingdom politics.\r\nHis parents never forced him into military life.\r\nHe chose it himself.', 'Laborer', 20, 39019, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 17, 20, 100, 40, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 14:39:14', '2026-08-04 20:52:00', NULL, '2026-08-02 19:01:59', '2026-08-08 14:39:14'),
(26, 25, 8, 'Manuel \"Brick wall\" Martinez', 26, 'A man extremely patriotic to his country and wants to fight its enemies and defend the homeland', 'Begger', 4, 7637, 5, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 79, 100, 10, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 05:08:16', '2026-08-07 22:51:54', NULL, '2026-08-02 19:52:29', '2026-08-08 05:08:16'),
(27, 32, 5, 'Dr Maldrick Pale', 26, 'An estranged Scientist from GreyBorg with a strange interest in rather odd and morbid experimentation for a better Grey. Other than that he just seems like an odd man with an interest in mechanical and plastic engineering.', 'Begger', 16, 11544, 8, 0, 0, 0, 0, 9, 100, 100, 80, 0, 'military', 1, 0, '2026-08-08 09:09:59', '2026-08-03 22:54:47', NULL, '2026-08-02 20:22:53', '2026-08-08 09:09:59'),
(28, 33, 8, 'Colonel Olivia', 16, 'brand new high ranking officer of the new Purlanese ... Imperium?', 'Begger', 1, 175, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 91, 100, 85, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-05 03:49:54', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-02 20:34:16', '2026-08-05 03:49:54'),
(29, 36, 2, 'Scott \'Shock\' Greendale', 37, 'Veteran of the invasion of tangeria, hero of the battle of the fidget spinner', 'Begger', 1, 100, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 100, 100, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-08-03 16:33:13', '2026-08-03 16:33:13'),
(30, 37, 2, 'Aven Winters', 30, 'from a rural area, he joined a guard unit, and soon joined the armed forces, is a down-to-earth person who thinks like those in the mud than in a office far from the front', 'Begger', 1, 128, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 13, 100, 70, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-06 17:23:32', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-03 18:39:48', '2026-08-06 17:23:32'),
(31, 19, 6, 'Nate', 21, 'My parents were killed by mercenaries of an unknown color. i will find who is responsible and end them. Let\'s see how my journey progresses from here.', 'Begger', 20, 4533, 6, 0, 0, 0, 0, 5, 16, 100, 30, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 00:26:33', '2026-08-08 00:26:37', NULL, '2026-08-03 19:00:04', '2026-08-08 00:26:37'),
(32, 40, 2, 'Knight', 27, 'Born in a little town im the Marshes. Kinda outgoing with friends, easy to piss off if you say or act dumb.', 'Begger', 1, 146, 1, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 16, 100, 70, 0, 'civilian', 0, 0, '2026-08-04 20:21:39', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-04 13:34:21', '2026-08-04 20:21:39'),
(33, 35, 2, 'tigerclawz', 24, 'tiger was born in a small town in greenland, joined the service at 18 and soon climbed the to the rank of captain', 'Begger', 1, 166, 7, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 56, 100, 0, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-05 02:43:52', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-05 01:18:46', '2026-08-07 02:34:00'),
(34, 41, 2, 'Lincoln Greenson', 20, 'Trying to find my way around Greenland and strive to get to the top of then green royal bureaucracy', 'Begger', 16, 4640, 3, 0, 0, 0, 0, 3, 123, 100, 70, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 14:11:52', '2026-08-07 15:47:33', NULL, '2026-08-06 01:14:15', '2026-08-08 14:11:52'),
(35, 9, 1, 'Lt.general/raptorhman18', 19, 'someone who wants to be a soldier', 'Begger', 1, 187, 9, 0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 24, 100, 55, 0, 'military', 0, 0, '2026-08-08 07:20:26', NULL, NULL, '2026-08-06 03:52:51', '2026-08-08 07:20:26');
