(1, 1, 4, 'Red + Tan Alliance and Military Frontline Distribution on the Tangerian front.', '1500 Soldiers to march to Iztanbul to prepare to capture the city, with 50 Tanks, 10 Artillery and 5 Bombers. Frontline to be supported by 1-2 companies formatted along strategic defense points of the front line. \r\n\r\nTan and Red agreement to be implemented immediately. Document signed accordingly below: \r\n\r\nhttps://docs.google.com/document/d/1pi24aVYgzPvNyAwOglGB5dDVSsSZEugmiTXxmakJmW4/edit?tab=t.0', 'submitted', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2026-07-26 06:24:03', '2026-07-26 06:24:03');
